   Tuyishime, Josine; Soro, Dodiomon, Univ Felix Houphouet Boigny UFHB, African Ctr Excellence Climate Change, Biodivers \& Sustainable Agr CEA CCBAD, UFR Biosci, POB 165, Abidjan 31, Cote Ivoire.
